                                                            <span class="header__prodtitle">Explore Core Strategies</span>
                                                            <p class="header__prodannounce">Tailored for benchmark-conscious, long-term buy-and-hold investors, as well as global institutional investors seeking extended primary market liquidity and robust risk management capabilities.</p>
                                                            <ul class="header__prodlist">
                                                                                                                                    <li data-linkclicker="area-nobubble" data-ga="header_product" data-label="DA20" class="lk__area">
