                                                            </button>
                                                            <span class="header__prodtitle">Explore Staking Strategies</span>
                                                            <p class="header__prodannounce">Bitwise Staking ETPs offer exposure to the respective underlying token, while capturing staking rewards that are accumulated in the ETP. Bitwise Staking ETPs follow a transparent benchmark and can provide larger staking returns than other similar ETPs on the market.</p>
