                <section class="advantages">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="etp__grid">
                    <div class="etp__header">
                                                <h2>Bitcoin exposure<br> through a regulated ETP</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="etp__faq accordion" id="aboutCollapses">
                        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/collapses.min.css?hash=d1cb459f9b4a3baac0080760fc136f8f6e716de8">        <div class="collapse__container "  >
            <button class="collapse__toggler collapsed" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-element="faq-collase" data-target="#adv_col1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="adv_col1">
                <span id="adv_col1-toggler">
                    Trade Like Shares                </span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse__content collapse "
            id="adv_col1"
            class="collapse"
            aria-labelledby="adv_col1-toggler"
            data-parent="#aboutCollapses"            >
                Tradable on stock exchanges through standard securities accounts, similar to shares or ETFs. No crypto wallet is required. Platform availability may vary.            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse__container "  >
            <button class="collapse__toggler collapsed" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-element="faq-collase" data-target="#adv_col2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="adv_col2">
                <span id="adv_col2-toggler">
                    Physical ETP Structure                </span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse__content collapse "
            id="adv_col2"
            class="collapse"
            aria-labelledby="adv_col2-toggler"
            data-parent="#aboutCollapses"            >
                The ETP is fully backed by digital assets and includes a physical redemption feature.            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse__container "  >
            <button class="collapse__toggler collapsed" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-element="faq-collase" data-target="#adv_col3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="adv_col3">
                <span id="adv_col3-toggler">
                    Cold-Storage Custody                </span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse__content collapse "
            id="adv_col3"
            class="collapse"
            aria-labelledby="adv_col3-toggler"
            data-parent="#aboutCollapses"            >
                Assets are held with a regulated custodian, segregated from the issuer’s own assets. A trustee oversees custody arrangements and helps protect investor claims in the event of issuer default.            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse__container "  >
            <button class="collapse__toggler collapsed" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-element="faq-collase" data-target="#adv_col4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="adv_col4">
                <span id="adv_col4-toggler">
                    Regulatory Framework                </span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse__content collapse "
            id="adv_col4"
            class="collapse"
            aria-labelledby="adv_col4-toggler"
            data-parent="#aboutCollapses"            >
                With a base prospectus approved by the German financial authority, the ETP is listed and tradable on one or more European stock exchanges. Investors should note that while the ETP is listed on regulated exchanges, the underlying cryptoassets are not regulated.            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse__container "  >
            <button class="collapse__toggler collapsed" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-element="faq-collase" data-target="#adv_col5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="adv_col5">
                <span id="adv_col5-toggler">
                    Transparency of Holdings                </span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse__content collapse "
            id="adv_col5"
            class="collapse"
            aria-labelledby="adv_col5-toggler"
            data-parent="#aboutCollapses"            >
                Weekly balance reports by an independent administrator provide investors with full transparency into assets held in custody. <a href="/resources/proof-of-holdings/" target="_blank">Learn more</a>            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse__container "  >
            <button class="collapse__toggler collapsed" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-element="faq-collase" data-target="#adv_col6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="adv_col6">
                <span id="adv_col6-toggler">
                    What are the risks?                </span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse__content collapse "
            id="adv_col6"
            class="collapse"
            aria-labelledby="adv_col6-toggler"
            data-parent="#aboutCollapses"            >
                
                <p>Investors should be aware that investing in crypto assets involves significant risks, including but not limited to:<p>
                <ul>
                <li>Volatility Risk: The price of crypto assets and crypto exchange traded products (ETPs) can fluctuate significantly.</li>
                <li> Liquidity Risk: Market depth and trading volumes may vary, affecting execution.</li>
                <li>Custody Risk: Despite institutional-grade custody, digital assets may be vulnerable to cyber threats.</li>
                <li>Regulatory Risk: Crypto assets and their treatment are subject to evolving regulatory frameworks.</li>
                <li>Market Risk: Broader market movements can impact the value of the ETP.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>While there may be potential for significant gains, you are at risk of losing part of or your entire capital invested. For complete information please refer to the relevant Final Terms and the Base Prospectus.<p>
                            </div>
        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
