                        <p class="aside-cookie__text"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="18">Some cookies are strictly necessary for the operation and security of our Site. They are always active.</span></p>
                        <p class="aside-cookie__text"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="19">All other cookies and similar technologies are non-essential. These include cookies used for analytics, functionality and advertising. These cookies are only set after you have given your consent. Some of these technologies are provided by external providers, which may process data outside the EEA. Advertising cookies may also be used by our advertising partners to build a profile of your interests and display relevant advertisements on this and other websites.</span></p>
                        <p class="aside-cookie__text"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="20">You can accept all, reject all or, if you would like to choose which categories to allow or would like more information, you can click on "Settings". You can change or withdraw your choice at any time via "Cookie Settings" in the Site footer. Details of the providers involved are available under "Settings" and in our Cookie Policy.</span></p>
                        <p class="aside-cookie__text">
                            <a href="/cookies-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="15">Cookie Policy</span></a>                            &nbsp;/&nbsp;
                            <a href="/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="16">Privacy Notice</span></a>                        </p>
                    </div>
                                        <div class="aside-cookie__footer">
                        <button type="button" class="bw btn btn-md-2 btn-dark" data-cookie-accept><span class="lang" data-translationindex="22">Accept all</span></button>
                        <button type="button" class="bw btn btn-md-2 btn-dark" data-cookie-reject><span class="lang" data-translationindex="23">Reject all</span></button>
                        <button type="button" class="bw btn btn-md-2 btn-light aside-cookie__last" data-cookie-settings><span class="lang" data-translationindex="21">Settings</span></button>                    </div>
                                </div>
                <div class="aside-cookie aside-cookie--settings">
                    <div class="aside-cookie__head">
                        <div class="aside-cookie__title"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="24">Manage your preferences</span></div>
                        <button type="button" class="aside-cookie__close" data-cookie-close title="Close" aria-label="Close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M1 1L10 10M10 10L19 19M10 10L19 1M10 10L1 19" stroke="#010203" stroke-width="2" /></svg></button>                    </div>
                    <div class="aside-cookie__scroll">
                        <p class="aside-cookie__text aside-cookie__intro"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="25">Choose which categories you allow. Rejecting optional categories does not prevent you from using our Site. You can change or withdraw your choice at any time via "Cookie Settings" in the footer.</span></p>
                        <div class="aside-cookie__switches">
                                <div class="aside-cookie__switch">
        <div class="aside-cookie__row">
            <div id="essentialCookiesName" class="aside-cookie__name"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="0">Strictly Necessary Cookies</span></div>
            <button id="essentialCookies" type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" aria-labelledby="essentialCookiesName" class="bw switch switch_on" data-switch="on" disabled                >
                <span>on</span>
            </button>
        </div>
        <div class="aside-cookie__description">
            <p><span class="lang" data-translationindex="1">These cookies are essential for the operation, security and core functionality of our Site. They enable functions such as page navigation, network management, security, fraud prevention, load balancing, user authentication, and remembering your privacy preferences. Without these cookies, the services you have requested cannot be provided. These cookies do not require your consent under applicable law and cannot be disabled through our Cookie Settings.</span></p>
