        <div class="aside-cookie__description">
            <p><span class="lang" data-translationindex="10">These cookies are used to deliver advertising that is more relevant to your interests, to limit the number of times you see an advertisement, and to measure the effectiveness of advertising campaigns. They may also be used by our advertising partners to build a profile of your interests and display relevant advertisements on this and other websites. Where required by applicable law, these cookies are used only with your prior consent.</span></p>
                            <p><span class="lang" data-translationindex="11">If you reject this category, no advertising cookies will be set and your visit to our Site will not be used for our advertising on Google.</span></p>
