                        >
                <div class="aside-cookie__item-body"><p>Conversion linker tags store ad click information in Browser Local Storage (key: _gcl_ls).</p><p class="aside-cookie__meta"><span class="lang" data-translationindex="26">Provider:</span> Google (Google LLC) · First party (set by third-party tag) · Local storage · <span class="lang" data-translationindex="9">Targeting and Advertising Cookies</span> · <span class="lang" data-translationindex="27">Duration:</span> Until browser site data is cleared; Google expires the entries in it after 90 days</p></div>            </div>
