        <div class="aside-cookie__description">
            <p><span class="lang" data-translationindex="13">These technologies are placed by social media platforms when their content or features are embedded on our Site, or when you interact with social sharing buttons or embedded content. They may collect information about your visit and your interactions with those features, and share this information with the relevant platform. This may occur even if you do not click on the relevant feature. Where such technologies involve non-essential processing, they will only be activated following your consent. We use the LinkedIn Insight Tag on our Site for conversion tracking, audience building and retargeting purposes. This technology is provided by LinkedIn Ireland Unlimited Company and is activated only after you have provided your consent via our Cookie Banner.</span></p>
                            <p><span class="lang" data-translationindex="14">If you reject this category, the LinkedIn Insight Tag will not be activated and your visit to our Site will not be used for our advertising on LinkedIn.</span></p>
