            <span class="buy-now-broker__close-cross"></span>
        </button>
        <div id="buy-now-broker-content" class="buy-now-broker__inner">
            <div id="buy-now-broker-header" class="buy-now-broker__header">
                <h3 class="buy-now-broker__title">
                    How to buy Bitwise Physical Bitcoin ETP<br>                </h3>
                <div class="buy-now-broker__description">
                    <button buy-now-broker-back type="button" class="bw btn btn-arrow-left btn-md mt-2">
                        <span>
                            Back to overview                        </span>
                    </button>

                    <p>
                        You can buy this ETP using your existing brokerage or investment account, subject to platform availability. The product is available through a range of participating platforms, including but not limited to:                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="buy-now-broker__select">
