                        </fieldset>

                        <small class="mb-5">This list is not exhaustive. Platform availability may vary. Please check directly with your broker, bank, or financial adviser to confirm access to Bitwise ETPs.</small>

                        <div class="buy-now-broker__info how-order-broker">
                            <span class="buy-now-broker__subtitle">
                                How to order the ETP in stock market trading:                            </span>

                            <ul class="how-order-broker__list">
                                <li class="how-order-broker__item">
                                    Log in to your online securities account.                                </li>
                                <li class="how-order-broker__item">
                                    Open the order entry section.                                </li>
                                <li class="how-order-broker__item">
                                                                        Enter ISIN <span class="how-order-broker__copy" data-clipboard="DE000A27Z304" data-container="body" data-toggle="popover" data-placement="top" data-content="Copied to clipboard" data-ga="product_ISIN"><span class="my-icon my-copy"></span><span>DE000A27Z304</span></span>, WKN <span class="how-order-broker__copy" data-clipboard="A27Z30" data-container="body" data-toggle="popover" data-placement="top" data-content="Copied to clipboard" data-ga="product_WKN"><span class="my-icon my-copy"></span><span>A27Z30</span></span> or ticker <span class="how-order-broker__copy" data-clipboard="BTCE" data-container="body" data-toggle="popover" data-placement="top" data-content="Copied to clipboard" data-ga="product_ticker"><span class="my-icon my-copy"></span><span>BTCE</span></span> for the product.                                </li>
                                <li class="how-order-broker__item">
                                    Select the relevant trading venue – such as the London Stock Exchange (LSE).                                </li>
                                <li class="how-order-broker__item">
                                    Choose the order amount and confirm your transaction.                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <small>Trading availability may depend on your broker’s platform settings, account type, and regulatory permissions.</small>
                        </div>

                        <div class="buy-now-broker__info">
                            <span class="buy-now-broker__subtitle">
                                What to do if the ETP is not available to you?                            </span>

                            <p>
                                If the ETP does not appear in your trading platform, contact your broker’s or bank’s customer service team to request access.<br> Please include the product ISIN and ticker in your request.<br> If you experience difficulties, you can email clients@bitwiseinvestments.com for assistance.<br> Our team can liaise with your trading platform or bank to help resolve access queries.                            </p>
                            <small>This information is provided for general guidance only and does not constitute investment advice. Investors should confirm platform availability and suitability with their broker, bank, or financial adviser before investing.</small>
                        </div>
                        <div class="buy-now-broker__info">
                            <p>Risks Involved in Investing in ETPs</p>
<ul>
    <li>Cryptocurrencies and products linked to cryptocurrencies are highly volatile.</li>
    <li>You can lose some or all of your investment.</li>
    <li>Risks of investing are numerous and include market, price, currency, liquidity, operational, legal, and regulatory risks.</li>
    <li>Exchange traded products do not offer a fixed income or match precisely the performance of the underlying cryptocurrency.</li>
    <li>Investment in cryptocurrencies and products linked to cryptocurrencies are only suitable for experienced investors and you should seek independent advice and check with your broker prior to investing.</li>
</ul>
<p>All investors should read the relevant base prospectus and final terms contained on this website before investing and, in particular, the section entitled ‘Risk Factors’ for further details of risks associated with an investment.</p>                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="buy-now-broker-second-content" class="buy-now-broker__second-content d-none">
                        <div class="buy-now-broker__info buy-now-broker__info--second-step">
                            <span class="buy-now-broker__subtitle">
                                Redirection to external website                            </span>

                            <p>The website or web pages to which you are redirected are not owned by Bitwise. Bitwise therefore shall not be held liable for any information, data, details, explanations and representations (hereinafter referred to as "Information") provided on such websites, in particular not for damages that may result from the use of this Information for your own investment decisions. Price and performance data on the websites of Bitwise may differ from the price information on the websites of the respective online brokers or banks.                            <p>
                            <p>The information on the websites to which you are redirected is the sole responsibility of their providers. The offers you find on the providers' websites are expressly not directed at persons in countries that prohibit the provision or retrieval of the content posted therein. Each user is responsible for finding out about any restrictions before accessing the websites and complying with them.</p>
                            <p>By clicking the "Continue" button, you will be forwarded directly to the website or login or order screen of the selected provider. In the case of an order form, the following fields are usually preset: ISIN, buy/sell and exchange. It should be possible to change such fields at any time. We recommend to carefully check all the details in the securities order form before placing an order.</p>
                            <label for="buy-now-broker-checkbox" class="buy-now-broker__checkbox checkbox">
                                <input type="checkbox" id="buy-now-broker-checkbox" checked>
                                <span class="checkbox__box"></span>
                                <span class="checkbox__text">
                                    By clicking continue, I agree that I have read and understood the disclaimer about the forwarding to external websites.                                </span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
